Linus,

please pull sound fixes for v2.6.36-rc6 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

All small and local fixes as below.

Thanks!


Takashi

===

Dan Rosenberg (1):
      ALSA: sound/pci/rme9652: prevent reading uninitialized stack memory

Dimitris Papastamos (1):
      ASoC: Fix soc-cache buffer overflow bug

Erik J. Staab (1):
      ALSA: oxygen: fix analog capture on Claro halo cards

Guennadi Liakhovetski (1):
      ASoC: fix clkdev API usage in sh/migor.c

Luke Yelavich (1):
      ALSA: hda - Add Dell Latitude E6400 model quirk

Mark Brown (1):
      ASoC: Fix multi-componentism

Takashi Iwai (1):
      ALSA: hda - Fix auto-parse of SPDIF input of Realtek codecs

